                <Activity className="w-5 h-5 text-[#1cb085]"/> ?ºÏù¥?ÑÎ°úÍ∑??îÏïΩ (ÏµúÍ∑º 7??
              </h3>
              <div className="space-y-4">
                {latestLogs.slice(0, 7).map((log, i) => (
